    <span class="hero-label">ABOUT THE MUSEUM</span>

    <h1>Preserving Our Past,<br>Inspiring Our Future</h1>

    <p>
      The Oriental Mindoro Heritage Museum preserves and shares
      the cultural, historical, and natural heritage of Oriental Mindoro.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="museum-page-content">

    <h2>Our Museum</h2>

    <p>
      Through its collection of artifacts, photographs, traditional objects,
      and historical materials, the museum provides visitors with an opportunity
      to discover the stories, traditions, people, and communities that have
      shaped the province.
    </p>

    <p>
      The museum serves as a space for learning, appreciation, and cultural
      preservation, helping ensure that the heritage of Oriental Mindoro can
      be remembered and valued by future generations.
    </p>

  </section>

